# Goal: walk FDT for memory / UART / virtio / optional framebuffer; cut hardcodes.
# Extends the 0.2 memory@reg stub (now via kernel/src/fdt.rs).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Work to land before tagging 1.5.0:
#   W1  Shared FDT walker (compatible, reg, interrupts) — kernel/src/fdt.rs
#   W2  Discover UART / virtio MMIO / memory; log nodes at boot
#   W3  Optional: locate ramfb / simple-framebuffer for 1.9 prep
#   W4  Smoke: boot logs fdt: lines; RAM from DTB (QEMU -m)
#
# Releases:
# 1.5.0   FDT-driven discovery for core platform devices (landed with 1.6.0)
# 1.5.y   Parser / binding fixes only
#
# Out of scope for 1.5: full Linux DT binding zoo, ACPI, multi-board product matrix.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1.6.x  Block / console virtio polish (finish 1.4 intent)
# Goal: real virtio-blk (or equivalent) behind existing FS/DRFS path APIs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Work to land before tagging 1.6.0:
#   W1  virtio-blk backend; keep DRFS / shell ls/cat stable
